WEBVTT

00:19:29.505 --> 00:19:32.976
whether I'm holding my breath
or shuffling a deck of cards,

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.976
is pretty simple.

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:38.582
It's practice, it's training,
and it's -- (Sobs)

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:42.262
It's practice, it's training
and experimenting,

00:19:42.286 --> 00:19:43.557
(Sobs)

00:19:43.581 --> 00:19:46.710
while pushing through the pain
to be the best that I can be.

00:19:46.734 --> 00:19:50.143
And that's what magic
is to me, so, thank you.

00:19:50.167 --> 00:19:53.674
(Applause)